<title>RUSSIA: Russian Dec unemployment steady at 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Dec unemployment steady at 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia was 6.8 million at the end of December, or 9.3 percent of the workforce, little changed from 9.4 percent in November, the State Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT		 Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>    number unemployed (million)	 6.8	  6.8	  6.0</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	     9.3	  9.4	  8.2</p>
<p>    officially registered (million)   2.5	  2.5	  2.3</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	     3.4	  3.4	  3.2</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
